<title>KYRGYZSTAN: Kyrgyz trade gap widens to $15.6 mln in Jan'97.</title>
<headline>Kyrgyz trade gap widens to $15.6 mln in Jan'97.</headline>
<dateline>BISHKEK 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kyrgyzstan's foreign trade deficit widened to $15.6 million in January this year from $12.3 million in the same period last year, the National Statistics Committee said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>    KYRGYZ FOREIGN TRADE		 Jan '97	     Jan '96</p>
<p>    Export				     32.1		  5.7</p>
<p>    Import				     47.7		 18.0</p>
<p>    Balance				   -15.6		-12.3</p>
<p>Note: figures in millions of dollars</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
